# What `vercel deploy` must never upload (2026-10-13). Git-connected deploys
# only see tracked files anyway; this protects CLI deploys from a local copy.

# secrets / local env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local
*.pem
*.p8
*.p12
*.jks
*.key

# not part of the website or its API
.claude
mobile
docs
supabase
dist
node_modules
public/test samples
*.log
.DS_Store
